ned to your feedback and reworked the snapping so assembling your book nook is as relaxing as it should be. Leave us a review! You can now leave a review on Steam and it would mean the world to us. Every review helps us understand what’s working ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:31:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4414620-1835236783564726","game_id":"steam-4414620","kind":"update","title":"Book Nook Demo Update!","summary":"Hey everyone! Thank you so much for all the feedback since the demo launched . You really helped us make it better. Here's what's new:New tutorials:A tip now reminds you to aim for the connector to snap pieces into placeA tip now shows you how to hold left click to remove a piece — no more figuring it out by accident!Improvements:The overall gameplay feels smoother and more satisfyingAdded a level reset buttonSmall pieces now move closer to you so they're easier to see and grabBug fixes:Various ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T21:07:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564726","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4414620-1834602721199672","game_id":"steam-4414620","kind":"announcement","title":"20,000 wishlists in 48 hours! We can't believe it!","summary":"Hi everyone! 20,000 wishlists in 48 hours. We can't believe it!! thank you so much for your support. And a huge thank you to Wholesome Direct for the visibility and for believing in us 🥹We've been reading every single comment in the discussions and we're already working on your suggestions. Keep them coming!Thank you. From all six of us Malapata Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T17:22:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721199672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4414620-1834602721194062","game_id":"steam-4414620","kind":"announcement","title":"Book Nook — World Premiere at Wholesome Direct + Demo Available Now!","summary":"Hi there! We're so excited to finally share Book Nook with the world! Today we premiered at Wholesome Direct 2026 with a brand new trailer, and our demo is available now on Steam. Official Teaser Book Nook is a satisfying puzzle game about the joy of building something with your own hands. Piece by piece, you'll craft tiny little corners full of life. We made as a love letter to our favourite Book Nooks. We really hope you feel that when you play it 🥹 Download the demo, jump into our Player Feed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T16:02:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194062","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4414620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4414620":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4414620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z"},"4530570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4414620","app_